{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1Z109YCyd6aDVGKq5qu1_A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.597405+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/1Z109YCyd6aDVGKq5qu1_A","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyGWt35WBRicdjX2LUHPuEc3p3Lx4ms8qPA8ufCPzWa53OibYahgbUyCeCZyVPUtfnwpHNBcGmhIjb1BwBr9cyRIUpxj1htlMZ8pE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>上海社会科学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生办法</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><span>欢迎具有推荐免试资格的国内优秀应届本科生，申请推荐免试攻读我院硕士研究生。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1LYoSDD6uyHsBSSNOHjuCib0m4h0O2VWCuEmcmptYZntF88TzicGrib9h2ugmaB1TznqyeKMjfOB3Qq2xJOySYL48VN3xgYIYGVNpAkfR8TMHs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyFLwpwAd3P4cJGXRKAVFWYYn0JI8FFljOYOSDib4bibAicAYTb5c9uxoUhPWLyBrMIBElLxTRyehYYKUwz72Z84B9yV52O1H6vhHE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.具有高尚的爱国主义情操和集体主义精神，社会主义信念坚定，社会责任感强，遵纪守法，积极向上，身心健康；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识，学术潜质和专业能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果等有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为以及其他违法违纪受处分或受处罚记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.能够获得所在学校推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.申请免试攻读硕士学位的专业须与申请者本科所学专业（含双学位、辅修）相同或相近；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.大学英语六级考试成绩达到425分（含）以上或能证明具有同等水平的外语成绩。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、申请程序</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyEyoIsoj6lT0T7hhoqXrm479QKQ0ic0xRP3CjwE84XIz912ZUYLur12JNZtwdiaNTFNUjCYdko9dibWyPEDOVQov71LMxnyicbv3XE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）研招网报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>获得推荐免试资格的考生，请于</span><span>9月21日9:00</span><span>开始登录《全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统》，在线填写报名信息，完成网上报名程序。考生报名前可咨询招生办或研究所推免招收及复试具体情况。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）申请材料提交</span></span></p><p><span><span>完成网上报名后，申请人须准备以下材料电子扫描件提交招生办和研究所邮箱：  </span></span></p><p><span><span>1.申请表1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.专家推荐信2封；  </span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本科成绩单（须加盖教务处或院系公章）；  </span></span></p><p><span><span>4.外语水平证明复印件，如CET四、六级成绩等；  </span></span></p><p><span><span>5.有关获奖证书和学术科研成果（发表论文、出版物或原创性工作）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>以上材料全院最终截止提交日期为</span><span>10月15日</span><span>，具体以各所要求为准，提交邮箱：yzb@sass.org.cn，参加复试的同学请复试当天带好所有原件在复试前前往我院研招办进行资格审核。  </span></span></p><p><span><span>未按所规定时间提交上述材料者，其网上申请无效。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请时间：正式报名为</span><span>9月21日-10月15日</span><span>，正式报名时间以教育部规定的时间为准。申请人在网上提交的信息必须准确、有效，凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实，将取消申请资格。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、选拔考核程序</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyGVtBxlkQqGhkwVfzkBMcUdI98Bt3A35t8HeicjzvVekGPzSRVV6xdlibib8Oeiaicz2W6Dm8Wicl95g3reVKjWozaCMlCJHMteWQDeY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.研究所组织专家对申请材料进行初审后，由研究所通知进入复试的申请人参加复试的时间和具体流程，复试时间由各研究所自行确定，时间范围：</span><span>9月22日至10月20日</span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.复试成绩按百分制计算，不及格者（低于60分）不予录取。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.参加复试的申请人均须进行综合面试，面试过程全程录音录像。  </span></span></p><p><span><span>4.对于通过复试并拟被我院录取的申请人，需在规定时间内登录推免服务系统，在系统中确认我院拟录取通知；在规定时间未确认的学生，将视为放弃拟录取资格。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、其他事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyGl2iaR1vFJshTXV5mbooEuGWvuZzroOJzbFFrhg48urUOdGQFuvsVtcgkibEiaXkEnJNyLCiabJFPBgfW9eNlrJ4bqUZ3noIdCl2Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1. 2027年可接收推荐免试硕士研究生的专业以最终官网公布和正式报名系统为准。推免硕士研究生入学后可享受除学业奖学金、普通助学金以外的一次性新生推免奖学金8000元。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。若申请人弄虚作假、违反招生规定、存在有违学术道德、专业伦理、诚实守信等方面的不当行为，一经查实，立即取消复试资格、录取资格、入学资格或学籍。</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院拟录取的推免生应出色完成大学本科阶段的学业，并按期毕业，拟录取后如出现以下情形之一者，将被取消录取资格或入学资格：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）思想政治素质和品德考核不合格或政审不合格；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）从推免生报名至入学报到之日受到任何处分；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）我院规定的研究生新生入学日期前无法提供毕业证书和学士学位证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.如本办法的有关内容与教育主管部门日后下发文件不一致的，以教育主管部门下发文件为准，我办将及时公告变化内容，请申请人予以密切关注。  </span></span></p><p><span><span>4.研究生院招生办咨询方式：021-64871225，yzb@sass.org.cn，在填报申请资料过程中如有疑问也可添加“</span><span>上社研招咨询sassyzb</span><span>”微信进一步咨询了解。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1LYoSDD6uyHOM7mibnOrG6U7NREnEdZQOBNO9I30Hibf0hptrB9O5jiaC81x7TVG9QvvF0YJK6NKrMzXwJ7YyFGd4USwSyICiamYjXwrCjwH5MI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyEg4EnSgUMEZmINiapKLk6a2PcQ65vnRqvfIppAP62aEIt8iaMoUuWBicP8yBZRxsNajWeCxKTibp2pA0ib8sHJu2rrgUkLbzvAtCD4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyHH7AIaIQ5olsdye9fGAM90zicRTSJr0Yp5yuy7eTyk37BbHU7iac1RnAnTCBOiamNiabLvKF6egjV3knd7CKEStAyCW7g0dbyBzYE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyE5uQ9qf4RgZkqOtNq7JSn1LerpdHSNyUwpD0FzTMUWEnLJNGo54f10h06fibiandR6PpSwIjHwNkCp05w1ChfDp5soGCKTqmQnU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>上海社会科学院（学校代码：87903）</span></span></p><p><span><span>各研究所（中心）招生联系人</span></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyEEq227IWWu6fYQvuvKafibr8P3fLQ1u7gcfs1JqtEMLuicon90QyIxsrkLVjdB0dCpMoumkwmiahTTn1YwRlmNwurJeWQAFI24CA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/1LYoSDD6uyHiaTBYJ2qm8StOP9sdgyPLvd41bzDeSrvtSWY2Ku9pCmG1eeDxcibSlia4kaB1icFtlTHmB3A5FGIGHdQKgrjTJy994Gy0sj3HO4Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1LYoSDD6uyHAnmnoKgYw0AR2IRzicC2vnZoNbeEvRvTMI1Nwnx7yIfkN9QdvfJQGAOM43wVYQ8N5K4IibR0kG6icIwqHg9ibDBXRzUVH4KbxtSA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/1LYoSDD6uyGNXibf4VlMYDrSl2AP2eG16d5IzjxYibU4H0Jy6cghC1ACRu8icXcc9bRFGCU36fkgLf4R7UJTGEkyDb06D8MsK6dCmH0vWvhKibM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"2873023734a7eb13d999683cad4b7b1fcfbf7ef1675ed8db637fa873d0389a14","textLength":1515,"sourceSha256":"790fb71e0b1a0e6dde929c9b01f2a12c9e04537e088ab7a94f3d080d19bf4f9c","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a2af2f6dcf2bb160b870","title":"2026年上海社会科学院2027年接收推荐免试硕士研究生办法","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:41.597405+00:00"}
